---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import RippleMark from '../components/RippleMark.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About Panta — a friendly partner in the growth of your mission"
  description="Panta LLC supports community-based businesses and organizations with web and software development, business process improvement, and creative design — strategy and engineering from the same hands."
>
  <section class="section section--dark hero" style="padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">About Panta</p>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem);">A friendly partner in the growth of your mission.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Panta exists to help community-based businesses and organizations grow
        their reach — by improving how they work, what they can build, and how
        the world finds them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid grid--2" style="gap: 3rem; align-items: start;">
        <div>
          <p class="label">What we believe</p>
          <h2>The organizations that hold communities together deserve big-company capability.</h2>
          <p>
            The businesses and organizations we admire most are usually
            excellent at what they do and stretched thin everywhere else. They
            don't need a tech team — they need a partner who can name the
            problem, remove it, and move on. That's the practice we've built.
          </p>
          <p>
            We're plain-spoken, reassuring, and specific. Every recommendation
            we make is backed by something we can actually build — because the
            same hands do the strategy and the engineering.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="label">What we do</p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>
              <strong>Digital presence.</strong> Audits, websites, profiles, and
              the systems that connect them — starting with the
              <a href="/audit/">Digital Presence Audit</a>.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Web &amp; software development.</strong> Sites and custom
              tools scoped to what you actually need, not what's fashionable.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Business process improvement.</strong> Making the
              complicated part quiet — intake, follow-up, measurement.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Creative design &amp; marketing.</strong> A presence
              that's recognizable everywhere your audience meets you.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--bamboo">
    <div class="container" style="display: grid; gap: 2rem; justify-items: start;">
      <RippleMark size={56} />
      <div>
        <h2>The ripple</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width: 54ch;">
          Our mark is a planted seed sending ripples outward — one clear act at
          the core, its effect widening into the world. It's how we see our
          work: a fixed contact form, a claimed listing, a faster reply. Small
          moves, felt everywhere your community reaches.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">Practicing what we preach</p>
      <h2>This website is our own audit, passed.</h2>
      <p>
        The first project Panta ever took on was ourselves. Everything we check
        for clients — a headline that says what we do in five seconds, one
        clear next step, fast pages, consistent information, working forms —
        we built into this site first. Ask us about it on a call; we'll show
        you the scorecard.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary">Start a conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
